## 🐛 Known Issues & Limitations

### Current Limitations
- Sound effects are simple beeps (no complex audio)
- Particles have basic physics (no wind, no complex interactions)
- Maximum particle count limited by browser performance
- Mobile touch may be less responsive on some devices

### Browser Quirks
- iOS Safari: May require user interaction before sound works
- Firefox: Shadow effects might have slight performance impact
- Edge: Fullscreen may require user permission

